    {
      "text": "Look closely at the clock and think about the time.",
      "key": "d5a7e72e",
      "path": null,
      "ready": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The short red hand shows the hour. The long blue hand shows the minutes. The hour hand moves between numbers.",
      "key": "67fb9b78",
      "path": null,
      "ready": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the short red hour hand and the long blue minute hand.",
      "key": "6438eb4b",
      "path": null,
      "ready": false
    },
    {
      "text": "That is right. The hands show the time.",
      "key": "7fe2ea5b",
      "path": null,
      "ready": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen to the number line mission.",
      "key": "ae34656e",
      "path": null,
      "ready": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the number line to check one step at a time.",
      "key": "2752f08b",
      "path": null,
      "ready": false
    },
    {
      "text": "That is right. The number line shows each hop and landing.",
      "key": "ebc7abfb",
      "path": null,
